OL,3,GNEWSABoy pulled from river was a 'loyal
OL,4,Afriend with a great sense of humour'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy whose body was pulled
OL,7,Ffrom a river in Dumfries was a loyal
OL,8,Ffriend to many and had a great sense of
OL,9,Fhumour, his former school has said.
OL,11,FKenzie Carmichael, 16, was found in the
OL,12,FRiver Nith near the boathouse on Nith
OL,13,FAvenue following reports that he had
OL,14,Fcollapsed at 19:35 on Wednesday.
OL,16,FEmergency services attended and he was
OL,17,Fpulled from the water but was
OL,18,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
