OL,3,GNEWSABoy pulled from river was a 'loyal
OL,4,Afriend with a great sense of humour'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSt Joseph's College in Dumfries said
OL,7,FKenzie had excelled in practical
OL,8,Fsubjects and had left the school to
OL,9,Fpursue a further education course.
